
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>푸레브수렝 노밍다리 | 소개</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #102a43;
      --navy-light: #1d4e75;
      --sky: #eaf4ff;
      --cream: #f8fbff;
      --text: #243b53;
      --accent: #f6ad55;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Pretendard", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans KR", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--cream);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* 상단 소개 영역 */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 80px 8% 90px;
      color: var(--white);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--navy-light));
    }

    .hero::before,
    .hero::after {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      content: "";
      opacity: 0.18;
    }

    .hero::before {
      width: 270px;
      height: 270px;
      top: -110px;
      right: -60px;
      background: #67e8f9;
    }

    .hero::after {
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      bottom: -90px;
      left: 45%;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .hero-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
      color: #d9eaf7;
    }

    .emoji-decoration {
      position: absolute;
      right: 10%;
      bottom: 34px;
      z-index: 1;
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 7rem);
      transform: rotate(-8deg);
    }

    /* 본문 2단 구성 */
    .content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
      gap: 28px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: -36px auto 0;
      padding: 0 8% 70px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 30px;
      border: 1px solid #e4edf5;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.1);
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .profile-list {
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .profile-list li {
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
    }

    .profile-list li:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      color: #627d98;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .value {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .interest-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .interest-tags span {
      padding: 9px 14px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 700;
      background: #e6f2ff;
    }

    .likes {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .like-item {
      padding: 20px 10px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #f7fbff;
    }

    .like-item .icon {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .goal {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 22px;
      border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 0 14px 14px 0;
      background: #fff8ed;
    }

    .goal p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #5d3b16;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 22px;
      color: #829ab1;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* 스마트폰 반응형 */
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 58px 7% 105px;
      }

      .emoji-decoration {
        right: 7%;
        bottom: 18px;
      }

      .content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: -42px;
        padding: 0 5% 45px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .likes {
        gap: 9px;
      }

      .like-item {
        padding: 15px 6px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <span class="tag">MY PROFILE</span>
      <h1>푸레브수렝 노밍다리</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        청추대학교 경영학과에서 새로운 아이디어와 사람들의 선택을 배우고 있는 학생입니다.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="emoji-decoration" aria-hidden="true">🚀</div>
  </header>

  <main class="content">
    <section class="card">
      <h2>👋 기본 정보</h2>
      <ul class="profile-list">
        <li>
          <span class="label">이름</span>
          <span class="value">푸레브수렝 노밍다리</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="label">학교</span>
          <span class="value">청추대학교</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="label">소속</span>
          <span class="value">경영학과 2학년</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="label">Instagram</span>
          <span class="value">@nouumu_mn</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>✨ 관심 분야</h2>
      <div class="interest-tags">
        <span>🛍️ 유통</span>
        <span>📣 마케팅</span>
        <span>💡 창업</span>
      </div>

      <h2>💙 좋아하는 것</h2>
      <div class="likes">
        <div class="like-item">
          <span class="icon">☕</span>
          카페 탐방
        </div>
        <div class="like-item">
          <span class="icon">📚</span>
          새로운 배움
        </div>
        <div class="like-item">
          <span class="icon">✈️</span>
          여행과 도전
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="goal">
        <strong>🎯 나의 목표</strong>
        <p>사람들의 일상에 긍정적인 변화를 만드는 브랜드를 만들어 가겠습니다.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 푸레브수렝 노밍다리. All rights reserved.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
